        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwine tipacipagwa magambo gakuwulagana, gakukanganilana yindu, kapena gakupwetekana m'misinda jenu, naga kulamula kwa magambogo kukwasawusya ŵandu ŵenu ŵakulamula panganya, mjawule nago magambogo kumalo gamo gitacisagula AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu kuti mkamlambileje ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni mkagapelece magambogo kwa jwakulamula magambo jwali pa masengo pa jele ndaŵijo, jwali pamo ni ŵakutaga mbopesi ŵa ci Lefi ni mwalecele jemanjajo kuti alamule magambo genugo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali alamwile magambogo, jemanja mkatende yosope yitakamsalileyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkajiticisye kulamula kwawo kwa magambogo, soni mkayitende yosope yitakamsalile kuti myitende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu jwalijose jwangapikanila yakusala jwakutaga mbopesi jwakwatumicila AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu, kapena jwangampikanila jwakulamula magambo jwali pa masengo pa jele ndaŵi jakulamula magambogo, awulajidwe. Pakutenda myoyo cakusakala ca mtundu welewo ticicityoka pasikati pa Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu jwalijose jutacipikana jele nganijo, Tiwucimkamula woga, ni pangali mundu jutacilinga kutenda yakusakala ya mtundu welewo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakwenela kutenda ayimwene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
