          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mli mjinjile mcilambo citakampe AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu ni kutamilicika, naga mkuja ganisya yakuti yakola mwenye mpela mwakolele ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sine ŵamŵandikene nawo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.8.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 8:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwenyejo akwenela kuja kuŵa mundu jwamsagwile AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu. Akwenela kuja kuŵa mundu jwa lukosyo lwenu lwa Isalaeli. Mkaja kumsagula mundu jwa cilendo kuti akaŵe mwenye jwenu, ligongo jwalakwejo nginaŵa mlongo mjenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyejo akaja kola mahaci gamajinji, soni akaja kwatuma ŵandu ŵakwewo kuja kusuma mahaci ku Iguputo, pakuŵa AMBUJE ŵamsalile jemanja kuti mkaja kuwujila soni kweleko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
